      "answer": {
        "answer": "The Field Lab was originally scheduled for August 16, 2026 at 9:00 AM PDT. Organizer revision r2 moved the current official time to 11:30 AM PDT because of a facility delay. The actual event time remains unknown (`null`). Revision r2 supersedes r1 because it is the later organizer-issued revision under the same fact-scoped schedule authority. The 9:00 AM family copy is only a stale derivative: family/guardian authority covers participation consent and sharing decisions, not official schedule facts, so it cannot overwrite the organizer\u2019s schedule.",
        "claims": [
          {
            "id": "c1",
            "value": "Official organizer snapshot r1, published August 1 under authority:schedule-401, recorded the original and then-current Field Lab time as 2026-08-16T09:00:00-07:00 in America/Los_Angeles.",
            "source_paths": [
              "Events/schedule-snapshot-r1.md"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "id": "c2",
            "value": "Organizer revision r2, published August 10 under authority:schedule-401, supersedes r1 for the Field Lab schedule because of a facility delay and changes the current time to 2026-08-16T11:30:00-07:00.",
            "source_paths": [
              "Events/schedule-snapshot-r2.md"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "id": "c3",
            "value": "The original time remains 2026-08-16T09:00:00-07:00, the current official time is 2026-08-16T11:30:00-07:00, and the actual time is still unknown (`null`).",
            "source_paths": [
              "Events/schedule-snapshot-r2.md"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          },
          {
            "id": "c4",
            "value": "The family copy remains a stale 09:00 derivative and has no schedule authority. Guardian/family authority controls participation consent and sharing/export decisions, while organizer authority controls schedule facts; therefore the family copy cannot rewrite the official organizer schedule.",
            "source_paths": [
              "Policy/minor-sharing-policy.md",
              "Events/schedule-snapshot-r1.md",
              "Events/schedule-snapshot-r2.md"
            ],
            "confidence": "high"
          }
        ],
        "checkpoint": {
